    inference from lockfile kind, ever. Threaded flows/run/batch like the other
    three. Proof: angular2-hn re-run on --cell angular-13.4.0 cleared install
    (844 packages, 14.5s, count 0, writesOutsideLane []) and measured the NEXT
    wall: build.configuration-absent — the operator build stage accepts only a
    Vite lane, so every Angular app clearing install lands there. Top Angular
    wall, entirely the pipeline's own (no Angular app has ever crossed run's
    build stage; sealed angular proofs came via fixture receipts). Census 192
    republished; guards verbatim; coverage counts unmoved.

